[{"answer":"Thorndyke's","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Good morning. Is that Mr Thorndyke?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/3.mp3"},{"answer":"How can I help?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got quite a few things which need painting and fixing in the flat","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/5.mp3"},{"answer":"and I wonder whether you'd be able to do the work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure I'd be able to help but let me take down a few details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, firstly, how did you hear about us?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/9.mp3"},{"answer":"It was my friend May Hampton...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/10.mp3"},{"answer":"you did some excellent work for her a couple of years ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you remember?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes, that was in West Park Flats, lovely lady.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, she is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/14.mp3"},{"answer":"And what's your name, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/15.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Edith Pargetter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/16.mp3"},{"answer":"can you spell your surname, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/17.mp3"},{"answer":"It's P-A-R-G-E-T-T-E-R.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Double T, right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/19.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you live in West Park Flats as well?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/20.mp3"},{"answer":"No, actually it's East Park, Flat 4.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, right, that's over the road, I seem to remember - quite difficult to get to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's at the back of the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/24.mp3"},{"answer":"And what's your phone number?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/25.mp3"},{"answer":"875934","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/26.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm out a great deal in the afternoons and evenings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/27.mp3"},{"answer":"So would the best time to ring you be in the morning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine. I've made a note of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I just ask, I'll be in a van and I know parking's rather difficult round your flats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Where would you recommend?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I always tell people in larger vehicles to park by the postbox on the other side of the road from the entrance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Good, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/34.mp3"},{"answer":"And will you be able to give me a full itemised quote?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes, I'll list all the jobs separately with individual prices.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/36.mp3"},{"answer":"That'd be a great help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/37.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what would you like me to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Firstly and most urgently is in the kitchen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/40.mp3"},{"answer":"With all the weather damage, the glass in the door has cracked and I'd need that fixing...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I presume you mean replacing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes. And as soon as possible...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/43.mp3"},{"answer":"What I'll do is come round tomorrow morning and do that immediately.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, thank you so much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/45.mp3"},{"answer":"The other things aren't so urgent but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, I'll make a note of everything you want doing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/47-2025-03-22-15-55-34.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, in the kitchen I'd like some painting doing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/48.mp3"},{"answer":"All the kitchen walls?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Just the area over the cooker.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It's very greasy...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Right... it does tend to get that way!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, if you want a proper job done what I'd need to do is strip the old paint and plaster it about a week before I paint it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, May tells me you also do work in the garden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/56.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'd like you to replace a fence.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Just one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, at the far end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine. Shouldn't be a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/61.mp3"},{"answer":"And that's the lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, as I say I can come round tomorrow morning to look over things with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's great, thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/65.mp3"},{"answer":"So, I'll look forward to seeing you tomorrow at...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-1-2023-06-16-15-47-56/66.mp3"}]
